<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19613" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰτ-ήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that on which one treads, threshold,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ αὐτὸν ἥκεις τὸν β. τῆς
			θύρας,</span> prov. of those who 'come to the point', 'hit the
			nail on the head', <i><span class="en">
				Amips.
				26
			</span></i>; <i>base</i> of a statue, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).147.18
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρχ. Ἐφ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1913.7
				</span></i>
			 (Nisyros, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>place from which one jumps,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				224
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1404.56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βακτηρία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				377
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>bridge</i> of a lyre, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; also, <i>part of flute,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>one who walks,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
